SUMMARY:Sober Game Night
DESCRIPTION:Sober Game Night\nJoin us for Sober Game Night on the last Friday of every month from 6:00 to 8:00 p.m. Enjoy an evening of fellowship\, food\, games\, and fun in a welcoming sober environment. \nBring your favorite snack to share while listening to classic AA speaker tapes\, and enjoy a variety of board games and activities with friends in recovery. \nLocation:\nSCIF Meeting Hall\n750 Mendocino Ave.\, Suite 9\nSanta Rosa\, CA 95401
URL:https://sonomacountyaa.org/event/8864/
LOCATION:SCIF Meeting Hall\, 750 Mendocino Avenue\, Suite 9\, Santa Rosa\, CA\, 95401\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sonomacountyaa.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/game-night.png
END:VEVENT
