SUMMARY:Seminar: It's Fellowship!
DESCRIPTION:AA Fellowship Seminar: IT’S FELLOWSHIP!\n\n\n\n\nHow diners and taco trucks saved my hide! Join us for an afternoon of fellowship\, sharing\, food\, and fun at this special AA Fellowship Seminar.\n\n\n\n\n\n📅 Saturday\, September 12\, 2026\n🕐 1:00–4:00 PM\n📍 SCIF Meeting Hall\n750 Mendocino Ave\nSanta Rosa\, CA\n\n\n\n\nWhat’s Happening?\n\n\n\n\n 	Four-person speaker panel & sharing\n 	Potluck & BBQ — bring something to share!\n 	Prize ticket drawing! Proceeds support the Meeting Hall Improvements Fund.\n\n\n\n\n\nCan’t make it in person? You can join us on Zoom!\n\n\n\n\n\nZoom ID: 860-4370-3384\nPasscode: 62\n\n\n\n\n\nCome for the speakers\, stay for the fellowship!
URL:https://sonomacountyaa.org/event/seminar-its-fellowship/
LOCATION:SCIF Meeting Hall\, 750 Mendocino Avenue\, Suite 9\, Santa Rosa\, CA\, 95401\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://sonomacountyaa.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/fellowship.jpeg
END:VEVENT
